Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 4.4.15-rt23 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 4.4.15 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v4.4-rt
  Head SHA1: 27df5dad54944684e50dd4690e0bbc4038e3f54a


Or to build 4.4.15-rt23 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-4.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-4.4.15.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/4.4/patch-4.4.15-rt23.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
